==English==
[[File:Pastor Batoré, Praça da Sé, São Paulo.jpg|thumb|'''Bible thumper''' stereotype.]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|Bible-thumper}}

===Etymology===
Evoking the image of a vocal and zealous preacher, one who might literally thump a Bible for emphasis while preaching.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

